window.products.push({"id":302008,"name":"NORHOM Cool Mist Humidifier, 300ml Humidifiers with Night Light, 20dB Quiet Humidifiers for Bedroom , Waterless Auto-Off Air Humidifier for Home, Livi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Lcg7gumML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【☆Kindly Reminder】✔️Only tap water could be used for this humidifier. Don’t use pure water ,distilled water, mineral water or essential oil, which will cause water to accumulate in the mist outlet. ✔️Completely soak the cotton filter core for A FEW minutes before use. Otherwise it will not start or the spray volume will be small. ✔️Any problem, please feel free to contact with us. 【🌿Norhom Mini Cool Mist Humidifier】With this cute shape, it could be used as a ornament.With colorful atmosphere light setting,this mist humidifier creates a peaceful ambiance while delivering soothing mist. It is suitable for kids and adult who are afraid of the dark in night. 【💨One Button Control】The portable humidifier is very easy to operate. One button controls all functions. You just need to press the power button to control the mist. This mini humidifier has two mist modes: Continuous and intermittent mode. Keep pushing the power button for 3 seconds and it will turn on the colorful night light. It is an ideal gift for children, friends, couples and so on. 【🌼 Auto Shut-Off】It will be turned off when the water level is low. So it has the Protection against dry heating,you don't have to worry about the humidifier being damaged in the absence of water. You can use it at night and sleep well. 【📣Quiet Working】The operating sound of the mist humidifier is only 20~25dB. It will not disturb you when you sleep or work, it can effectively moisturize dry skin and help you reduce skin peeling. 💖PS: There will be a brief light on, while you start the humidifier. If you want to turn on the night light mode , you need to press and hold the button for 3 seconds.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Lcg7gumML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NORHOM","source_asin":"B09MYV24SK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-302008","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MYV24SK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MYV24SK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":302009,"name":"Melange Coupe 6-Piece Porcelain Salad Plate Set (White) | Service for 6 | Microwave, Dishwasher & Oven Safe | Salad Plate (6 Each)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QpzCZfAzL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"An everyday porcelain dinnerware set designed to last and impress your guests, crown that dinner party, or upgrade your everyday dinnerware with an elegant porcelain dinner set that epitomizes durability. We've combined high-quality porcelain with a unique chip-resistant design to create a dinner set that you can use every single day without dealing with constant cracking, flaking, or chipping. - vitrified at temperatures of over 2480F. - microwave, oven and dishwasher safe. - 0 percent porosity for greater durability. - complete set for service of 4 or 6 or 8 or 12. - elegant patterns and lovely glaze. For daily use no dealing with fragile dinner sets that you only whip out whenever you have company. Mélange dinnerware is strong enough to handle the rigors of daily use. You can safely use it in the microwave, clean it in the dishwasher without breaking, and even use it to reheat food in the oven up to 400F everything you need every set comes with a dinner plate, salad plate, soup bowl and maybe a Mug; everything you need to serve your family or guests a full course meal. Understated elegance simple yet eye-catching, our range of designs exude an effortless elegance that blends into just about any setting. Beautifully done detailing meets lovely colors and a well-done glaze to create porcelain place settings with a premium feel. Get one set for yourself and a couple more as Gifts and experience the Magic of Mélange. About Mélange dinnerware is all about treating you to everyday elegance. We Believe fine dinner sets shouldn’t mean fragile dinner sets. We Believe every meal should be complemented by dinnerware that makes you smile. That's why we’ve used premium materials to bring on the durability, special craftsmanship to enhance the longevity, and lovely detailing to catch anyone’s eye.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QpzCZfAzL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Melange","source_asin":"B07HS63Q8D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-302009","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HS63Q8D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HS63Q8D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
