window.products.push({"id":302095,"name":"Embossing rolling pin ANGEL, Easy Cookies series, for Baking Embossed Cookies, Cute Kitchen Tool for Kids and Adults","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616wyvGoA-L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"PERFECT IN WORK. Cooking with our rolling pin is a pleasure. Roll out the dough, make patterns with an embossing pin and bake in the oven. It's easy to prepare beautiful homemade cookies, Christmas cookies, patterned pasta, cute ones from pastry mastic, make a clay cup with your own hands and decorate it with patterns. You can use a rolling pin to work with plasticine or polymer clay. Look for inspiration around and experiment. Enjoy cooking! EASY TO CLEAN: No need to wash the embossing pin before first use. It is washed 3 times and soaked in vegetable oil. Avoid contacts with water, otherwise, the polymer layer of the oil may be washed off. After use, clean it with a dry brush to remove dough pieces. If the embossing pin cannot be cleaned with a dry brush, try to clean it with water and a toothbrush as quickly as possible. GIFT FOR LOVED: You can use this beautiful patterned rolling pin as a present for your loved ones and friends for Birthday, Christmas, Mother's Day, Valentine's Day and other events. ORGANIC: Rolling pin made of solid wood. Important! Do not dry the washed product near a heat source. Do not wash it in the dishwasher. Avoid prolonged contacts with water. A special cookie dough recipe and instructions are printed on the package. SIZE AND WEIGHT: Total length with handles is 35 cm (14 inches). The length of the drawing is 18.5 cm (7.28 inches). The rolling pins are 4 cm (1.57 in) in diameter and weigh about 230 g (8 oz).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616wyvGoA-L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lubimova.com","source_asin":"B07M9BGZYQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-302095","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07M9BGZYQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07M9BGZYQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
