window.products.push({"id":302292,"name":"MaxS Kitchen Supplies Acrylic Knife Rest Kitchen Knife Block Stand Holder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6145UVMexPL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Universal storage, allows you to insert knives anywhere Size:7.5*4*9inch This knife block makes a great house warming, wedding, New Years or even Christmas gift. The knife holder block is suitable for all types of kitchens, whether chic and modern, warm and rustic or timeless and classic. Protects your cutlery and also keeps them close for your convenience. The utility knife holder is a knife block without knives but can fit up to 10 knives of your favorite knife type or favorite knife brand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6145UVMexPL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Unknown","source_asin":"B01JRQT6C0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-302292","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01JRQT6C0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01JRQT6C0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":302293,"name":"Churchill China Jardinet 20-Piece Dinnerware Set, Service for 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51excGsEkmL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Blue and White has remained a time less Classic. Rosemont continues this great tradition and in the unique style of Queen's blends the enduring appeal of blue and white with a classic floral motif and border Amazon.com Jardinet, a \"little garden\" in French, is designed for those who enjoy dining with a sense of refinement at every meal. Crafted in classic rim styling, the glossy white china shows borders fully filled with a floral pattern in soft blue and gray tones, while a single floral image, much like a detailed rendering from a book of botanical prints, is showcased in the center. Three such flower prints, in pink, blue, and lilac, are found across the range of dinnerware pieces; only the saucer in this set does not feature the full border. Despite Jardinet's delicate appearance, the vitrified china is quite durable and is safe for use in both the microwave and dishwasher. Four place settings are included in this 20-piece starter set, each comprised of a dinner plate, salad plate, soup or cereal bowl, teacup, and saucer. A matching serving set is available separately or as part of the larger 45-piece dinnerware set. Rounding out the collection is the charming Jardinet teapot, which also works well for serving coffee. Churchill China, base in the historic pottery town of Stoke-on-Trent, England, manufactures china for both the hospitality and home markets, and in recent years has won awards for its innovative designs. --Ann Bieri What's in the Box 4 place settings. Each place setting consists of: dinner plate; salad plate; soup bowl; teacup; saucer. 20 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51excGsEkmL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Churchill China","source_asin":"B000NV7BTY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-302293","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000NV7BTY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000NV7BTY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
