window.products.push({"id":302297,"name":"Koinus Ultra Thin Pillow, Flat Pillows for Sleeping Thin Memory Foam Pillow, Cooling Low Profile Pillow for Stomach and Back Sleeper with Neck Pain (2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617MHsVwmDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Boon For Stomach and Back Sleepers : Koinus standard size 24x16x2.5 inch extra thin pillow provides you with enough neck support to keep your spine properly aligned,Reduce snoring, Help with breathing and improve neck, Back and shoulder pain, You will recharge during sleep and wake up refreshed every morning! Refuse to Sleep Hot : Are you a hot sleeper? 49% Polyester, 51% Rayon Derived from Bamboo.The dual cooling sensation of the cooling bamboo pillowcase and cooling gel memory foam reduces your tossing and turning at night due to overheating, Sleep safe and sound with moon! No Chemical Smell Cooling Memory Foam : 100% NO harmful chemicals! Our cool gel memory foam ultra flat pillow are made of odor-free and eco-friendly materials Certified by OEKO & CertiPUR-US, Is odor-free, The memory foam is equipped with small ventilation holes offers improved breathability that help to regulate body temperature as you sleep so you stay cool, Comfortable and sound asleep. Cooling Quality Fabric : Removable, Machine washable cover designed with ice silk bamboo material. For people with allergies it is the smart fabric available and provides a cooler sleeping experience than cotton pillow or bamboo bed pillow. That keeps you cool all night. You can finally wake up refreshed! Amazing Experience : Who really needs a extra slim pillow?The biggest goal of any bed pillow is to ensure spinal alignment and adequate support for your head. this is the only way that you will wake up pain-free in your neck, shoulders and upper back.So in theory, anyone can use a low Profile pillow, as long as it gives them enough rest. And in reality, flat pillow work best for back sleepers, stomach sleepers, people of small or petite stature, and children.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617MHsVwmDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Koinus","source_asin":"B0C24J439L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-302297","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C24J439L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C24J439L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
