window.products.push({"id":302352,"name":"South Shore Cookie Collection 4-Drawer Chest, Mocha and White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sTfA+okTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This cookie 4-drawer chest in mocha and white finish allows the continuous evolution of a room while adapting to each child's age and needs. As time goes by, children's interests change and their needs evolve. Match this chest with the items of your choice to create a room that will grow well with your child. It features 4 drawers with chromed finish metal handles. The interior drawer dimensions are 27-1/2-inch wide by 13-1/2-inch front to back and equipped with metal slides. Also available in champagne and white finish. Presents new and improved drawer bottoms made with wood fibers. It measures 31-1/2-inch wide by 16-1/2-inch deep by 42-inch high. It is delivered in a box measuring 45-1/2-inch by 17-1/4-inch by 6-3/4-inch and weighing 90-pound. Accessories not included. Manufactured from certified environmentally preferred laminated particle panels. Complete assembly required by 2 adults. Tools are not included. 5-year limited warranty. Made in Canada.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sTfA+okTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"South Shore","source_asin":"B07GFCX894","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-302352","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GFCX894","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GFCX894","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":302353,"name":"JOJAZE 2 Pcs Dried Flowers Stems Natural Dried Flowers Bouquet White Star Anise Flowers Dried Floral Arrangement for Vintage Boho Rustic Home Wedding ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yspcCXHQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"We all love the beauty of flowers, who wouldn't want to decorate their house, office cake, etc. with some beautiful and vibrant blooms. But we all know that once flowers are in your place, they die quickly, and many maintenance and living conditions require other options. This is why dried flowers are the most popular decorative products today. He not only retains the beautiful appearance of flowers, but also does not need to spend extra effort to maintain. They can keep your house looking gorgeous for years without maintenance and shedding. This lovely grass is perfect for your country style home decor. Add it to your wall display or display it on a shelf or in a vase. 100% Natural Flower Bouquet - A great gift from nature. All the grass is hand-picked by our farmers, dried naturally in the sun, and neatly packed before being shipped out. Tips - Please put it in a dry place, don't put it in a wet place, dried flowers need to breathe. Put it in the warm sun for a few hours and the feathers will fluff up again. Natural makeup mixed with gorgeous bouquet of dried flowers Creates a stunning natural ambience no matter where it is placed. Slightly larger compared to other bouquets, but still not a good fit for a large floor vase. Specifications: Size: 15.74 inches/40cm color: White Package Contents: 2Pcs dried flower bouquet, 38 heads","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yspcCXHQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOJAZE","source_asin":"B0BLN5H2ZB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-302353","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLN5H2ZB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLN5H2ZB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":302354,"name":"PRO-CUT KG-22-W Meat Grinder, 1 hp Motor, Stainless Steel Construction, Washerless Grinding System","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1513.8,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81T2Y1nvYoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PRACTICAL DESIGN The Pro-Cut KG-22-W #22 grinder has been designed for the ongoing and daily needs of butchers and other small commercial operations. Its footprint is only 31 x 11.5\" so it will not take much space on your counter. The KG-22-W meat grinder offers unbeatable ease of cleaning and sanitation thanks to its 100% polished food grade stainless steel cabinet. All parts in contact with food are easily accessible and readily removable for convenient cleaning without the use of tools. ROBUST CONSTRUCTION This grinder design is attractive and suitable for any open kitchen or supermarket. Its powerful oil bathed steel gear transmission with no belts or pulley to maintain guarantees a long lasting life with minimum noise and low maintenance cost. Its 1 HP motor provides fast, reliable and uniform results every time. It can process up to 28.66 lb/minute (1720 lbs/hr) on the first ground through an included 3/16\" plate. Anything you feed into the equipment will come out clean and retain all its natural color and flavor. SAFETY AND PERFORMANCE The body and headstock have been designed with no sharp corners or seams for added safety. This grinder includes an extra-large high grade stainless steel tray (3.5\"x16.5\"x31\") that's easy to clean, will endure years of tough use and will save you time besides preventing waste due to reduced product transfer. The KG-22-W is equipped with a permanently attached safety guard over the feeding area that ensures safety without affecting grinding capacity or performance of the grinder. Big chunks of meat can be easily and safely introduced from the side or top of the guard. For proper product handling and safety, you should always use the included stomper while operating this grinder. WASHERLESS TECHNOLOGY This grinder eliminates the use of washers decreasing maintenance costs and assuring a consistent grinding output. The grinding system is fully and easily dismountable. Removing the headstock of your grinder is easy thanks to its release lever. This means that your cleaning process will be faster and easier at the end of your working day. The grinding parts are made of a tin-plated cast iron, making them stronger, sanitary and corrosion resistant. FOOD PROCESSOR Besides being a very reliable meat grinder, the Pro-Cut KG-22-W can be transformed into a food processor by choosing different grinding plates that can help you create dips, beans, marmalades, jellies, salsas, guacamole and purees. There are 12 different grinding plates that can be purchased separately. Also it can be used as a sausage maker if used along with sausage tubes and casings (sold separately). TECHNICAL INFORMATION This meat grinder comes in 110V and 60Hz frequency so you can plug it into any regular household outlet right out of the box. It also includes a 3/16\" plate, a stomper and a grinding knife. The KG-22-W has been certified by ETL to comply with NSF-8, UL std 763 and CAN/CSA std C22.2 It has a One Year warranty for parts and labor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81T2Y1nvYoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PRO-CUT","source_asin":"B00JXIO8TO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-302354","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JXIO8TO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JXIO8TO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
