window.products.push({"id":302370,"name":"Click Clack Kitchen Style Canister, 4.2-Quart","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ym3K2qMjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For nearly twenty years Click Clack has been a leading designer and manufacturer of quality airtight storage. All Click Clack Storage units are airtight, provide easy access to contents and are unmatched for convenience. It's easy to organize your kitchen with the stackable Kitchen Style Canister Collection from Click Clack. One hand toggle operation allows easy access, while the strong, tinted base lets you easily identify contents. The black lids with silver toggles round out the sophisticated look. For best cleaning results, hand wash base and wipe dry. Wipe lids clean with a damp cloth or remove the air tight diaphragm from the lid and hand wash and dry parts separately before reassembling.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ym3K2qMjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Click Clack","source_asin":"B009S0G8AO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-302370","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009S0G8AO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009S0G8AO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":302371,"name":"Phone Headphone Adapter ZJT4-0814-VP952","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41DidMPVXgL._AC_.jpg","description":"Our latest addition to our ever-growing talavera line of products. Our Dizzy Liz (green base) has a hole in the back, making it perfect for hanging on walls. In our Multi-Color style. Use this enchanting little lizard to add charm and color to your home or garden. Please note that our multi-color styles each come in a different color combination. Dimensions: 5.0\" x 5.0\" x 1.5\". The striking ceramic known as Talavera is over 800 years old, originating in the Talavera de la Reina region of Spain. At that time, it was called Majolica. Known for its beautiful glaze work, Talavera was imported to Mexico in the 16th century where it was used to decorate monasteries and churches with tiles and religious figures. Talavera is not turned or tin glazed—the pigments are brushed onto raw or unfired glaze. Each piece takes between 12 and 15 days to complete. It must set for 16 to 18 hours before being liquefied and poured into molds. The pieces are then hand polished and fired for six hours at 1500 (F) degrees, then painted and baked again in an 1800 (F) degree oven. Prehispanic Mexican craftsmen blended the majolica process with their own interpretation of the method to work the clays of the region and incorporated their art forms and colors. Their product came to be known as Talavera. We are happy to pay about 20-25% above 'market' value to our artisans in Mexico in order to create a sustainable business for them as well as in the hopes of bringing up the standard of living of the community at large. Unlike other Mexican import companies we specialize in Mexican Talavera. We stand behind our products with a 100% satisfaction guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41DidMPVXgL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MX Imports","source_asin":"B009ZH1VD4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-302371","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009ZH1VD4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009ZH1VD4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":302372,"name":"Polish Pottery 7 oz Bubble Mug made by Ceramika Artystyczna (Maraschino Theme) + Certificate of Authenticity","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61i0H3yRLLL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Polish Pottery 7 oz Bubble Mug made by Ceramika Artystyczna, Maraschino Theme Certificate of Authenticity and origin is included Dimensions: 3.15\" high, 3.19\" wide, 4.25\" long, (max. outside edge or handle) Capacity: 8oz (filled to the rim) Polmedia Polish Pottery Stoneware is: * Hand crafted and hand painted in Boleslawiec, Poland * Microwave safe, dishwasher safe, oven safe up to 480 F, freezer safe * Lead and cadmium free * Crack and chip resistant * Intended for everyday use, easy to clean * Highly collectable About Polish Pottery Polish pottery is known for its versatility in the kitchen and on the table. It is safe for use with food in the microwave, freezer, oven and dishwasher. Polish stoneware is resilient to abrasives making it durable and resistant to scratching or chipping. It distributes heat evenly for perfect baking and is also nonstick for easy clean-up, making it easy to care for. The bright patterns never fade, and are offered in thousands of variations to mix and match. It is this combination of function and beauty that makes Polish pottery so appealing. The pottery is fired in electric and gas kilns at temperatures exceeding 2200 degrees Fahrenheit. This results in a stoneware that is meant to resist aging and provide lasting beauty that stands the test of time. Polish stoneware is lead and cadmium free.Polish Pottery is hand crafted and hand painted in the Boleslawiec region of Poland. This region is famous for its naturally found white clay which artisans have used for centuries to craft this durable and beautiful stoneware. Each piece of pottery is carefully formed and painted by hand to ensure that exceptional attention to detail is paid to each piece. The most beautiful and intricate patterns are called UNIKAT patterns.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61i0H3yRLLL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Polmedia Polish Pottery","source_asin":"B01LX27KRX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-302372","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LX27KRX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LX27KRX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
