window.products.push({"id":302920,"name":"Dried Preserved Real Eucalyptus Stems, 7-10 Pcs Natural Silver Dollar Seeded Eucalyptus Leaves Branches for Vase Filler, 15-17'' Fresh Plant for Weddi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v0J9yyT0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Real Plant-This is Preserved real Silver Dollar Eucalyptus possesses beautiful large green leaves! Get the look and feel of real eucalyptus, PRESERVED not just \"dried\"! - These stems remain flexible and keep a similar shape and ease of use that fresh stems have. Natural Eucalyptus Fragrance-Silver Dollar may have a scent, but there is no guarantee of the strength of the scent. The fragrance is much lighter than fresh stems. You can place this eucalyptus bunch in a vase or have it in your shower for aromatic and therapeutic benefits. Enjoy the healing powers of eucalyptus. Reminder-These will be sold as 7-10 pcs in one pack, stems vary in length 15''-17\". The silver dollar eucalyptus is a natural item harvested from nature, making it common for some leaves to have some imperfections, and each stem varies, leaves sizes to vary. The preserved items are not the true color of fresh eucalyptus and may darken over time but still remain a very close fit to how beautiful eucalyptus is and still feel fresh. Multiple Uses - These mixed eucalyptus leaves stems in bulk are suitable for wedding bouquets decor, eucalyptus wreaths, create a nature-inspired floral arrangements and table centerpieces with other flowers,They are great decorative greenery throughout the whole year to brighten up your surroundings. Easy Care and LONG-LASTING - These silver dollar bunches are preserved and will not dry out. No water needed! With minimal care, these bunches will remain the same for many years! RE-USE / RE-PURPOSE as longer-term home decor after your wedding or event!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v0J9yyT0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FUKUOKA","source_asin":"B0B8GPJT1W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-302920","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8GPJT1W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8GPJT1W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":302921,"name":"House, Home and More Skid-Resistant Carpet Runner - Chocolate Brown - 14 Feet X 27 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":149.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713KmkJ2G+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You’ll walk confidently on your new carpet runner from House, Home and More! Thanks to its non-slip rubber backing, this runner won’t bunch up or shift under your feet. Your household will appreciate the added security in your walking spaces, especially older adults. Our carpet runners protect and add comfort to your hardwood or tile floors and help muffle sound throughout your home. WHERE DO RUNNER RUGS GO? Carpet runners are perfect for high-traffic areas like hallways, entryways and kitchens. Furniture isn’t traditionally placed on top of runners. If you’re placing your runner in a hallway with furniture, choose a width that allows you to move the furniture to one side of the hallway without resting on top of the runner. Narrow kitchens are ideal living spaces for runners. Time spent at the stove or cleaning up at the sink is more enjoyable with a carpet runner under your feet. Bringing runners into your bedroom provides warmth and comfort, especially on hard floors. If you’re placing runners at the sides and/or foot of your bed, you want to cover the length of the bed, outside of accent furniture like nightstands. ARE CARPET RUNNERS PET FRIENDLY? Our carpet runners offer stability and a cozy place for your pets to rest. The non-slip backing adds traction and helps to create a secure environment for your dogs, cats and other pets. Walking on slippery wood or tile floors can be cumbersome and frightening for senior dogs and cats. The soft surface of a runner will keep their paws comfy while the added traction allows them to move with confidence. If you have pets, you may want to consider a color or design that won’t showcase their shedding. HOW TO CARE FOR YOUR CARPET RUNNER: Our carpet runners feature a non-slip rubber backing which helps to keep them in place while vacuuming, but can become damaged if put into a washing machine. When your runner needs cleaning, we recommend vacuuming to remove surface dirt and spot cleaning areas that need extra care.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713KmkJ2G+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"House, Home and More","source_asin":"B07C1WC7P2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-302921","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C1WC7P2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C1WC7P2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
